Package: openfuse
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: OpenFuse contributors <openfuse@invalid>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= @GLIBC@), libgcc-s1, libasound2t64 | libasound2, openfuse-dkms (= @VERSION@)
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Description: control panel for Arturia MiniFuse audio interfaces
 OpenFuse controls the settings of Arturia MiniFuse USB audio interfaces on
 Linux: instrument inputs, phantom power, direct monitoring, the loopback
 mixer and level meters. Audio itself already works with the standard driver;
 the controls are provided by the openfuse-dkms kernel module.
